{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "64abbf607bfdc1066de4448129e4a6dbc57259f09a566d5d824e78e06baa5b3f", "ja": "素敵なきっかけ……考えてもよくわからないし、\nとりあえず今日もお仕事がんばろうっと！", "zh": "美好的契机……想了想还是不太明白，总之今天也要努力工作啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "65a184341414aa0dbaf709d9a84d137b7efefd142581cdc0132a38fbc417ecc7", "ja": "お疲れさまです、青羽さん。\nさすがに寒くなってきましたね……ん？", "zh": "辛苦了，青羽小姐。\n天气也确实变冷了呢……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "7597541958dfd3952b77b14d9c1006d4406e7da47d91f2ce420f67e8b9060163", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん。\n？　どうかしましたか？", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生。\n？怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "82338a5c288cd33442534e905a8628a0438d8bd4ee1968d1034898bab006c1ad", "ja": "青羽さん……エステがお好きなんですか？\nよく見ると、お肌がツヤツヤですね。", "zh": "青羽小姐……您喜欢美容护理吗？\n仔细一看，您的皮肤真是光泽水润呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "67d2aa4162248f102381bc441d8888afa56f64f8b67fd56f319218adf4641c38", "ja": "えっ！？　好きというか、実は先日行った\nばかりで……どうしてわかったんですか？", "zh": "诶！？要说喜欢的话，其实我前几天才刚去过……你是怎么知道的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "baa49bd7e88073e830f4a9d9e3b3d28cb833f54edcad073d14238f960d2390b2", "ja": "いえ。そこの机の上に、エステの\nパンフレットがあったものですから。", "zh": "不是的。因为那边桌上放着美容院的宣传册。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "39f0e47eafca2d02ff1ef840e8e357bde0dfd263ef3fdae2cb5d20308257511a", "ja": "あっ！　す、すみません。\n私ったら、私物を出しっぱなしに……。", "zh": "啊！对、对不起。\n我真是的，竟然把私人物品乱放在外面……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d56cc3c6eb3123010a3c5a33d398f24ce4f1028f9ae25996c304fd9aad41dfc1", "ja": "いえ、ちょうどよかったです。実はエステの\n割引券を取引先からもらっていて……。", "zh": "没关系，正好。其实我从客户那里\n拿到了美容院的优惠券……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "0528f6eb77ee6d30aa863f90d6df2db7a9df124eb6f9640a0ad912e1c39032cf", "ja": "よかったら、いかがですか？\n結構な数があるので、遠慮なくどうぞ。", "zh": "如果不嫌弃的话，要不要去试试？\n数量还挺多的，请不用客气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_intro_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "4e1617db4ad90e95b9980cf822efc75a624297df42c2b9f1e0471877c972c29f", "ja": "わあ、いいんですか？　ありがとうございます！\nお姉ちゃんも喜ぶと思います♪", "zh": "哇，真的可以吗？太感谢了！\n我想姐姐也会很高兴的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "adf6f3e4d6744c7ab38fceb89a08dfb9650dfe92b99854c06fe0a70d7601e615", "ja": "素敵なきっかけ……。お姉ちゃんが\n言ってたのはこういうことだったのかも……？", "zh": "真是个美好的契机……姐姐说的就是这种事吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_intro_1011_p", "source_sha256": "053ae917d74137d85cafb57b43538c038903213c9d82ce789e40cda6cd61cbc8", "ja": "はい？", "zh": "什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_intro_1012_102mis", "source_sha256": "4ec5bc2e1c172b090e46ac691ff4be1e1956f2d2d1651ef6c86aa326623909b8", "ja": "いえ、なんでもないんです！　ええと、\n私からは伝言を。社長さんがお呼びでしたよ。", "zh": "不，没什么！那个，\n我这边有句话要转告您。社长刚才叫您过去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_intro_1013_p", "source_sha256": "8e00fc8bf0a593204eb0ca75922593e0054212a73852b91503f4bd7a45374ec2", "ja": "そうでしたか、ありがとうございます！\nこのまま事務所に向かっちゃいますね。", "zh": "这样啊，谢谢您！\n那我这就去事务所啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_intro_1014_102mis", "source_sha256": "752b45139e33c728e804b246c06175719b942694ee90d3268abd4c9f2e3000d1", "ja": "はい、いってらっしゃ～い♪　エステの割引券、\nアイドルのみんなにも配っておきますね！", "zh": "好的，路上小心哦～♪美容院的优惠券，我也会分发给偶像们的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_intro_1015_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "102faa96ce0a7486968e9ed6ad518aac2d6f5a88e6f0f1da9f010034666884b4", "ja": "汗ばむ肌、痺れるような快感、未体験の心地……！\nなるほど、そのような効果が……！", "zh": "汗湿的肌肤、令人发麻的快感、前所未有的舒适感……！\n原来如此，竟有这样的效果……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_intro_1017_101kot", "source_sha256": "cd4d245b12b83fffcd9739c5647bd6e1674ea9ded4423d43c5eb152af0297a10", "ja": "そうなんです。よかったら社長も体験されて\nみてはいかがですか？　いいお店を紹介しますから。", "zh": "就是这样。社长要不要也体验一下？我可以给您介绍一家不错的店。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_intro_1018_p", "source_sha256": "5b2bb3e0a417921837554dcb97eaeff83dbae995ab8f9c8ab2999ee56f224487", "ja": "社長、音無さん、お疲れさまです。なんだか\nお話が盛り上がってるみたいですが……？", "zh": "社长，音无女士，辛苦了。看起来你们聊得很起劲……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_intro_1019_president", "source_sha256": "edd3cbaa86ad420aa633ba323556ce3628327938f207b14a028bceec9544a099", "ja": "やあ君、音無君からサウナ講座を聞いていてね。\nなんでも、水風呂と外気浴が大切とか……。", "zh": "哎呀，我刚才正在听音无讲桑拿讲座呢。\n说是冷水浴和室外休息很重要什么的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_intro_1020_101kot", "source_sha256": "d37228b8c21d95e076612e3d53a15c82448fd99451aea0748f3dc17af09d7df0", "ja": "はい。そして「ととのう」と呼ばれるゾーンに入ると、\n生まれ変わったような快感を味わえるんです……！", "zh": "是的。而且一旦进入被称为“整”的状态，就能体验到仿佛重获新生般的快感……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_intro_1021_p", "source_sha256": "0c2c7d074eb40e0f83e19ce998707f0f4fc1ce13a903279de6094414092c36b7", "ja": "（音無さんは、エステよりもサウナなのかな……？\n割引券……渡すタイミングでもなさそうだ）", "zh": "（音无小姐比起美容护理，更喜欢桑拿吗……？\n现在好像也不是交给她折扣券的时机。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_intro_1022_p", "source_sha256": "f7ffa9dbbe243057b017748e57937eb9364c2e2c0691333fea972f27e25f25ed", "ja": "サウナ講座も面白そうですけど……\n社長、お呼びになった理由は一体……。", "zh": "桑拿课程看起来也很有意思，不过……\n社长，您叫我来的理由究竟是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "2d569b134eacfc6e8dd2677f7abd3ee64937a2e6febc48c8e2706aa5b745d218", "ja": "おお、そうだった！　新曲の感想を語っていたら、\n盛り上がってしまってね。よく話を戻してくれた！", "zh": "哦，对了！聊起新歌的感想，一不小心就聊得兴致勃勃了。多亏你把话题拉回来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "c4df98e3e93a91e1d638ba437a5f1cdb18b5d0b9a7d1b78fe31c8abc2ad28b49", "ja": "この新曲の公演を考えているんだが……まずは\n聞いてみて、率直な意見を聞かせてくれたまえ！", "zh": "我正在考虑用这首新歌举办公演……不过，先听听看，再直率地告诉我你的意见吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_intro_1026_p", "source_sha256": "3fa4b46f0d34acabd659711b8734b1fdf42625c5826eb1a4860af3d011450669", "ja": "おお、いいですね！　低音もかっこいいし、\n歌詞の妖しさ、初々しさも魅力的で……！", "zh": "哦，真不错！低音也很帅气，歌词中那种神秘感和青涩感也很有魅力……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_intro_1027_president", "source_sha256": "f57c6a0737a4997f35f898bea9b21dbe71b78075b99a656f117bb65b20fec9b3", "ja": "だろう？　この曲を歌いこなせる\nアイドルは、我が765プロの中だと……。", "zh": "对吧？能驾驭这首歌的偶像，在我这边的765事务所里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_intro_1028_101kot", "source_sha256": "9f708724a5423e0ed6ff876d24f10e345f790b998377eb55c679c80bd3294459", "ja": "大人過ぎても、子ども過ぎてもダメな気がしますよね。\nその上で刺激的な雰囲気も……う～ん、難しい。", "zh": "太成熟不行，太孩子气好像也不行呢。\n而且还要有刺激的氛围……唔～，好难啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_intro_1029_p", "source_sha256": "7168ed104ef4f7e3efd8168b41aff9e954e26f34eb5fd662831495833dff9272", "ja": "大人過ぎず、子ども過ぎず……。エレナと美希を\n組み合わせたら、面白いかもしれませんね。", "zh": "既不太过成熟，又不太过孩子气……。要是把艾莲娜\n和美希组合在一起，说不定会很有趣呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_intro_1030_101kot", "source_sha256": "a4dd8e0f102d8f9b652863a998149fe1ef35bdbda2b9351ece14adf455ea9d87", "ja": "エレナちゃんと、美希ちゃん……。\n10代の色気もあって、たしかにピッタリかも……！", "zh": "艾蕾娜和美希……。\n有着10多岁的魅力，确实很合适呢……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_intro_1031_president", "source_sha256": "f9508320c6c06103f956debc0c13d046dd696b69ceb2db524d93d4528e225356", "ja": "さすがのチョイスだ！　やはり今回の公演を\n成功に導くには、君の力が必要なようだ。", "zh": "真是个高明的选择！看来要让这次公演取得成功，果然还是需要你的力量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_intro_1032_president", "source_sha256": "f518ff274416d0a2bc796d5348f80d15f289c0d4571a95498b034ac18bb89d05", "ja": "最近かなり忙しいとは思うが……\nここはぜひとも君にお願いしたい！", "zh": "最近应该相当忙碌……\n但这件事还是希望拜托你来做！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_intro_1033", "source_sha256": "9c3e0eab7135bbf0124c363d162784a0708abfe045d94917138ffb36a58b21a3", "ja": "もちろんです！", "zh": "那当然！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "e781d7b127e4c831963b31d2cbcd8e8194584661703b94fd8b9d7b359b658d4d", "ja": "もちろんです！　この新曲を聞いて、黙っている\nほうが無理ですから。今回も全力を尽くします！", "zh": "当然！听到这首新歌，想保持沉默才难呢。这次我也会全力以赴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_intro_2001_101kot", "source_sha256": "0594ade55b74ffbb5fa1b0aeb0c1d524dbc0ef1991039b5296f143ced471d3c7", "ja": "頼もしいお返事ですね。サウナよりもうんと\n気持ちよくなれる公演、期待しちゃいます♪", "zh": "真是可靠的答复呢。真期待能有一场比桑拿还要舒服畅快的公演哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
